      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>This is the year of many exciting things. I have grand hopes for 2014.</p><p>Vengeance, Galactic Strike Force, at least playtesting Sentinel Tactics. GtG is looking good.</p><p>On a personal note, I have decided that this is my year to at least begin the process of getting one of my designs into print. There are four prototypes on my desk. Wait, five. Five prototypes on my desk right now, and one of them will find its way into a publisher&#39;s hands before the end of 2014. One already has, but I don&#39;t have high hopes for that.</p><p>Cheers for what we will make the best year of our lives.</p>",
