      "created_at": "2014-01-07T21:39:24.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Oh and I forgot to mention--I really do want to thank GTG for indirectly helping motivate me to get into shape in order to look better in my Tachyon costume. I was more or less able to still be a skinny boy in my Spite costume, since you can't see a whole lot of muscle on his normal side, but ever since I decided to dress up as Tachyon, I've been hitting the gym five days a week this past semester, and haven't stopped. When MTAC rolls around in April, I'm determined to pass for \"Matthew\" Stinson, who I imagine has some pretty nice legs.</p><p>Do you like cows?</p><p>Then you should check out my calves!</p><p>AAAYYYOOO</p>",
