      "raw": "<p>Oh and I forgot to mention--I really do want to thank GTG for indirectly helping motivate me to get into shape in order to look better in my Tachyon costume. I was more or less able to still be a skinny boy in my Spite costume, since you can&#39;t see a whole lot of muscle on his normal side, but ever since I decided to dress up as Tachyon, I&#39;ve been hitting the gym five days a week this past semester, and haven&#39;t stopped. When MTAC rolls around in April, I&#39;m determined to pass for &quot;Matthew&quot; Stinson, who I imagine has some pretty nice legs.</p><p>Do you like cows?</p><p>Then you should check out my calves!</p><p>AAAYYYOOO</p>",
